  "body_markdown": "![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/hm60r_1-1440x1080-1.jpg)\n\n### HM60R – Intelligent frecvency-sensing utdoor headlamp\n\nThe Fenix HM60R is an intelligent outdoor headlamp that provides ultra-long runtime. Featuring spot- and floodlights, the headlamp is excellent both in long-distance and wide-angle lighting. With the use of frequency-sensing brightness technology, the headlamp changes its brightness to adapt to different activities. As the user’s step frequency increases or decreases the brightness will gradually increase or decrease accordingly, which makes it truly intelligent for high-intensity trail running. A hidden USB Type-C fast charging design is used, a 54-hour runtime mode is considered for hiking, it is an excellent choice for long-term, high-intensity outdoor activities.\n\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/3-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/4-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/5-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/5-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/6-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/7-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/8-1440x1080-1.gif?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/9-1440x1080-1.gif?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/10-1440x1080-1.gif?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/11-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/12-1440x1080-1.gif?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/13-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/14-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/15-1440x1080-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/16-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/17-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n- ![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/19-1440x1080-1-1.jpg?w=1024)\n\n## Pret: 445 lei*\n\n#### *Speologii legitimați la un club/asociație/fundație de speologie, membre ale Federației Române de Speologie – FRS, Salvatorii Montani și Salvatorii Speologi legitimați la Asociația Națională a Salvatorilor Montani din România – ANSMR / Corpul Român Salvaspeo – CORSA beneficiază de un discount de 10% la toate produsele din gama Fenix Light!\n\nLike Loading...\n\n### Related\n\nPosted by[transilvaniacavediving](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/author/transilvaniacavediving/)[October 21, 2023](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/2023/10/21/fenix-hm60r-lanterna-frontala-1200-lumeni-116-metri/)Posted in[Uncategorized](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/category/uncategorized/)",
